  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2027.1.6: build check of the Resources files (build\\NovaWpfResourceCheck.proj, and the fingerprints of the Resources files of every NovaWpf version in build\\NovaWpf.Styles.resources.txt). A project with the target NovaWpfCheckResources (the templates and the commands of the NovaWpf Templates extension add it) gets the warning NOVAWPF001 when its Resources files are older than its NovaWpf packages; the command Update NovaWpf Resources of the extension updates them. No style or color changed. 2027.1.5: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.4: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.3: new theme colors for the new Nova controls (NovaSlider*, NovaChip*, NovaTag*, NovaBadge*, NovaNavigation*, NovaAvatar*, NovaSkeleton*, NovaImageUpload*, NovaFloatingActionBar*) in NovaLightColors and NovaDarkColors (additive, no key removed). 2027.1.2: new theme colors GalleryCode* (code panel of the NovaWpf gallery) in NovaLightColors and NovaDarkColors. 2027.1.1: Nova styles for Calendar and DatePicker, ContextMenu, Menu and MenuItem, Hyperlink (inline link), ListBoxItem, TabControl and TabItem, ToolTip (plain and NovaRichToolTip), TreeView and TreeViewItem; FAB, danger and text buttons; linear progress with the gap of the spec; radio button colors and focus. New colors in NovaLightColors.xaml and NovaDarkColors.xaml (additive, no key removed).",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "NovaWpf Styles",
